---
---

<section class="intro" id="top" data-audio-src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}audio/hero.wav`}>
	<span class="tick tl"></span><span class="tick tr"></span><span class="tick bl"></span><span class="tick br"
	></span>
	<div class="intro-inner">
		<span class="eyebrow">Personal career intelligence</span>
		<h1>How much of your job is already <span class="mark">AI's?</span></h1>
		<p class="sub">
			Uptomic turns your job title into a data-backed report — what AI can already do, what still needs
			you, and how to stay ahead of it.
		</p>
		<div class="cta-row">
			<a class="btn-primary" href="#">Score My Job →</a>
			<a class="jump" href="#get">↓ See what you get</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.intro {
		max-width: 1100px;
		margin-inline: auto;
		padding-block: 60px 20px;
		position: relative;
		border: 1.5px dashed var(--line);
		border-radius: 4px;
		padding-inline: 34px;
	}

	.intro-inner {
		max-width: 700px;
	}

	.intro h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5.4vw, 4rem);
		line-height: 1.02;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
		margin-block: 16px 18px;
	}

	.intro .sub {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		color: var(--ink-soft);
		max-width: 50ch;
		margin-bottom: 26px;
	}

	.cta-row {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 22px;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		margin-bottom: 8px;
	}

	.jump {
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-decoration: none;
		color: var(--ink);
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.jump:hover {
		color: var(--accent-ink);
	}
</style>
